"Sanjiao Beach is on the eastern tip of the Apex crescent, an evacuation area in emergencies."
"The Informant, Elias, runs his neighborhood there like a little fiefdom."
"Its green town square is ringed by dollhouse-like townhouses, around a three-meter jar fountain."
"Hundreds of 'keys of voices' hidden in the square's houses let Elias hear conversations anywhere."
"Elias activates his keys by pressing a hand to the fountain, where the first key is embedded."
"It has manufacturing workshops, a community center and many Wright apprentices."
"'Know thyself' is spelled in Greek in marble-like letters on the roof of its largest building."
"It was the one neighborhood untouched by the Matadero disaster."
